--- !u!114 &826506764
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 826506762}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 614608ac89ebf334b8f50b2e11230d38, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: Oh Lyka! Thank you for destroying that robot!
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 3
      effectSpeed: 3
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: I'm so glad you're safe! But...
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: They won't stop bothering us until all of us are gone, Lyka...
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Lyka
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 990c6f90ab95c7c4d85cb7881e550219, type: 3}
      line: I'm going to put a stop on all of this mess!
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: But how?
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Lyka
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 990c6f90ab95c7c4d85cb7881e550219, type: 3}
      line: I will talk to the their boss and see if there could be a solution other
        than... this.
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: If they're willing to burn the forest including us, would they even listen
        to you?
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Lyka
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 990c6f90ab95c7c4d85cb7881e550219, type: 3}
      line: Don't worry about a thing, Chief! It's me, I never fail!
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: Well... if you're that sure...
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: I will hand you my prized possesion.
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: My Itak.
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 2
      effectStrength: 3
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Lyka
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 990c6f90ab95c7c4d85cb7881e550219, type: 3}
      line: Oh, Chief, there's no need to-
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: I insist. Use it when you need to protect yourself, Lyka.
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Lyka
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 990c6f90ab95c7c4d85cb7881e550219, type: 3}
      line: I... I will take care of it. Thank you so much for trusting me to wield
        your Itak, Chief.
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
      effectStrength: 1
      effectSpeed: 5
      useCustomTypingSpeed: 0
      typingSpeed: 0.06
      itemRewardName: 
      itemRewardAmount: 1
    - character:
        name: Chief
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c886c5c023c8918428700d1409b7adf6, type: 3}
      line: Of course, Lyka.
      onLineStarted:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      textEffect: 0
