    - target: {fileID: 4244304153565597372, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Dialogue
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[0].line
      value: As the chief, you're the one we need to eliminate the most.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[1].line
      value: Why are you so eager to erase this whole land?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[2].line
      value: Our boss has been eye-ing this land for half a decade to build his next
        casino.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[3].line
      value: But he couldn't do anything since there are many people who wanted to
        protect this land.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[4].line
      value: Too bad that it is burning due to a "forest fire".
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[5].line
      value: You're monsters!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[6].line
      value: We are machines. Do not get it wrong. We are the future.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[7].line
      value: Initiating Execution.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[8].line
      value: No! Not like this! Help me!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[9].line
      value: 'I have to help him!

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5469018493871744654, guid: cd9a9c94c7bcb524fb41fddf747a36a3, type: 3}
